<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 1,634 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 1,634 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 1,634 contracts compared with 1,478 overnight Thursday.</p>
<p>There were 129 wheat, 667 corn, 624 soybean, 187 soymeal, 25 soyoil, one soybean call and one soybean put traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 3/4 to 2-1/2 cents lower, corn was two to three cents lower and soybens were 1-3/4 to six cents lower.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
